## OpenFront boat sprites

The transport ship, trade ship, and warship sprites in `assets/art/units/`
come from OpenFront and its contributors: `transportship.png`, `tradeship.png`,
and `warship.png` in `resources/sprites/`.

Source: https://github.com/openfrontio/openfrontio/tree/a8c87e3bf10f93dec77cba5eb5f844e59f3dc397/resources/sprites
License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Changes in Shadows of War: the files are renamed for the SOW asset catalog,
packed into the game's units atlas, and tinted at runtime with each fleet
owner's color. The sprites remain under CC BY-SA 4.0.
